  "description": "The Rask browser host: runs a Rask app's C# components client-side on .NET WebAssembly, with the client halves of the batteries — the mediator and query cache, remote dispatch, accounts, validation and the component kit — on by default. Ships the JS boot scripts, the page shell, and the MSBuild integration that stages them into the published bundle — and, opted in, prerenders every route to static HTML with a sitemap.xml at publish, so a static host serves real pages to visitors and crawlers. Depends on Rask, the shared core.",
  "iconFile": "rask-icon.png",
